@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
actor 运营
boundary RulesPanel
control RuleController
entity carbon_rule_version
entity trip_record
运营 -> RulesPanel : 输入新的模拟系数
RulesPanel -> RuleController : 携带Session CSRF发布
RuleController -> carbon_rule_version : 校验后插入不可变新版本
RuleController --> RulesPanel : 成功或重名冲突
note over trip_record
 历史行程保留规则外键和参数快照
 新版本不修改已发积分
end note
@enduml
